# Keys that may sign upgradoor releases (ssh-keygen allowed_signers format). A release is valid
# when upgradoor-manifest.txt carries a signature of any key listed here. CI checks against this
# file before it tags the image; Ansible checks against its own pinned copy
# (ansible-collection-general: roles/upgradoor_agent/files/allowed_signers), never one downloaded
# with the release. Add a key with scripts/enroll-signer.sh and change both files by review.
#
# Each line: upgradoor-release namespaces="upgradoor-release" <key type> <key> <owner>
